Acceptance criteria:
The DS renders blue-cyan instead of green in both lighting modes. Its lower
deck/rear, touch surround, cover and clips use slightly lighter blue paint
without altering the final lid, GBA, controls, geometry, logos, lights or
exposure. Actual shell-only sampling excludes screens, props and controls.
The lighter base improves same-lighting weighted RGB brightness by >15%.
Native DS functionality and resolution remain intact. No push/deployment.

